WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
- People want to know

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:03.970
if President Biden's vaccine
mandates are constitutional.

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.400
And the answer is probably yes.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.900
The first vaccine mandate with
respect to federal employees.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.130
Well, the President is the executive

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:14.870
and he can set some rules with
respect to federal employees.

00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:16.100
He can also set a lot of rules

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:17.560
with respect to federal contractors.

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:19.860
Now, the second mandate
involves employers and employees

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:21.510
who are not part of
the Federal Government.

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:22.990
That one is on more shaky ground,

00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:24.945
but that is also probably
still constitutional.

00:00:24.945 --> 00:00:25.778
Why?

00:00:25.778 --> 00:00:27.930
Because President Biden is using OSHA.

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:29.740
Now OSHA has existed for 50 years.

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:31.410
And the whole reason that OSHA exists

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:34.670
is to create safe working
environments for employees.

00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:36.890
Now, normally making a rule under OSHA

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:38.650
would take six to 10 years,

00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:40.340
but here President Biden is using

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.070
an Emergency Temporary Standard

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:43.960
that can only go into
effect for six months.

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:45.674
And while courts do look at these

00:00:45.674 --> 00:00:48.210
ETS temporary standards very carefully,

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:50.350
it's likely that he's
going to prevail here.

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:51.650
And under the Jacobson case,

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:53.750
the constitution isn't
going to stop the President

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:55.410
from mandating a vaccine.

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:57.220
So while we may see people in court,

00:00:57.220 --> 00:00:59.970
it's probably not gonna work
on these vaccine mandates.

